---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import DraftNotice from '../../components/DraftNotice.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy (Draft) — ${SITE.name}`}
  description="Draft privacy policy describing how this site handles personal data."
  noindex={true}
>
  <article class="space-y-6">
    <DraftNotice />

    <header class="space-y-1">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Draft last updated: {SITE.policiesLastUpdated}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Who we are</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        This site ({SITE.name}) is operated by <strong>{SITE.operator.legalName}</strong>,
        {SITE.operator.address}. For privacy questions, contact {SITE.operator.email}. The
        operator is the data controller for personal data processed through this site.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">What we collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>Information you send us</strong> — e.g. if you email us, we receive your
          email address and message.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical logs</strong> — our hosting provider records standard server
          access data (such as IP address, browser type, and pages requested) to operate and
          secure the site.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies</strong> — currently only strictly necessary cookies are used.
          Optional analytics are not yet enabled; see the
          <a href="/legal/cookies/" class="text-blue-700 underline">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Why we process it (legal bases)</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        Under the GDPR we rely on <strong>legitimate interests</strong> (operating and securing
        the site) and, where applicable, your <strong>consent</strong> (for any optional
        analytics or advertising, which would only run after you agree).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Sharing</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        We do not sell personal data. We use service providers (such as our hosting/CDN
        provider) that process data on our behalf under appropriate agreements. Outbound links
        to official government sources are governed by those sites' own policies.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">International transfers &amp; retention</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        Where data is transferred outside your region, we rely on appropriate safeguards (such
        as Standard Contractual Clauses). We keep personal data only as long as needed for the
        purposes above or as required by law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Your rights</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, restrict,
        or object to processing of your data, and to data portability. To exercise them, contact
        {SITE.operator.email}.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
        <li><strong>EEA / UK:</strong> you may lodge a complaint with your data protection
          authority (GDPR / UK GDPR &amp; PECR).</li>
        <li><strong>Switzerland:</strong> processing follows the revised Federal Act on Data
          Protection (FADP).</li>
        <li><strong>California (CCPA/CPRA):</strong> rights to know, delete, correct, and opt out
          of "sale"/"sharing" — we do not sell or share personal information.</li>
        <li><strong>Canada (PIPEDA)</strong> and <strong>Brazil (LGPD):</strong> equivalent
          access and correction rights apply.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Changes &amp; contact</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        We may update this policy; material changes will be noted here. Questions:
        {SITE.operator.email}.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
